  "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEpisodes of pain (crises) in the bones, chest, back or tummy\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETiredness and shortness of breath from anaemia\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFrequent infections\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EYellow eyes (jaundice)\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESwollen hands and feet in babies\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDelayed growth in children\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E"
}]]></Value>
