  "markup": "\u003Cp\u003ECare is led by a specialist team and includes:\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Edaily medicines such as folic acid, and for some people a medicine that reduces crises\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Evaccinations and preventive antibiotics to protect children from infections\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Epain relief\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eblood transfusions for some people\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ea bone marrow transplant, which can cure some people\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E"
}]]></Value>
